atlas forwarding

architecture address-plane
  canonical_name AddressPlane
  family forwarding
  domain Forwarding / Eligibility
  layer forwarding
  semantic_question Of all the state available, what is even eligible to participate in this operation?
  purpose A compiled bit-mask and ternary forwarding plane under the plural semantic estate. Rejects vast populations with (have & need)==need before any graph is walked, so semantic richness never becomes slow.
  maturity implemented
  node_types BitRegistry
  node_types Mask
  node_types TernaryState
  node_types Route
  edge_types eligible_for
  edge_types blackholes
  internal_calculus bitwise eligibility (have & need)==need
  internal_calculus ternary proof vector (+1 proven / 0 unresolved / -1 KnownNonCause)
  internal_calculus authority mask compiled from non-revoked in-window grants
  invariant bits are a compiled machine index, not meaning
  invariant eligibility rejects the impossible; it never grants authority or proves anything
  invariant a blackholed hypothesis is negative forwarding state, not a permanent truth
  forbidden_inference eligible -> authorized
  forbidden_inference a mask match -> a semantic match
  forbidden_inference a blackholed hypothesis -> permanently false (a reheat reopens it)
  native_format graf
  source_path 10-Code/BonfyreControlPlane/address_plane.py
  witness 10-Code/BonfyreControlPlane/tests/test_address_plane.py
  internal_calculus route funnel: capability -> authority -> proof rejection over the real estate
  internal_calculus CID prefix routing: longest-prefix placement partitions over content digests
  internal_calculus SID SimHash: angle-preserving LSH over real Bonfyre embeddings (bonfyre-embed)
  internal_calculus route advertise/withdraw: routes maintained by DBSP; a provider-down -1 withdraws its routes, alternates survive (anycast failover)
  forbidden_inference a CID prefix -> a semantic category (hashes are random w.r.t. meaning)
  forbidden_inference a small SID Hamming distance -> identity or evidence (locality suggests, never establishes)
  native_format graf
  interacts authority-graph
  interacts proof-frontier
  interacts capability-lattice
  interacts capability-closure
  interacts lance
  interacts hash-identity
  source_path 10-Code/BonfyreControlPlane/bonfyre_sid.py
  source_path 10-Code/BonfyreControlPlane/substrate/feldera_route_set_daemon.rs
  witness 10-Code/BonfyreControlPlane/tests/test_cid_sid.py
  witness ~/.bonfyre/substrates/v6.1/feldera/route-set-proof.jsonl
  witness 10-Code/BonfyreControlPlane/tests/test_substrate_feldera.py
  source_lineage AddressPlane / institutional packet-switching vision
  known_gap SID ANN via bonfyre-vec awaits the sqlite-vec extension; BitNet route ranking after deterministic pruning is the learned-optimizer layer
